  "title": "Air Fryer Green Beans with Spicy Dipping Sauce",
  "description": "Beer-battered tempura green beans made in and air fryer are just as crispy as those cooked in a deep fryer, but they're a little easier to justify eating.",
  "authors": [
    "bdweld"
  ],
